    "first_line": "BANDHU HE NIYE CALO",
    "lyrics_original": "BANDHU HE NIYE CALO\nÁLOR OI JHARANÁ DHÁRÁRA PÁNE\n\nBANDHU HE NIYE CALO\nÁNDHÁRER VYATHÁ ÁR SAYE NÁ PRÁŃE\n\nBANDHU HE NIYE CALO\nGHUMER GHOR BHÁMGA'NOR GÁNE GÁNE\n\nBANDHU HE NIYE CALO",
    "transliteration": "Bandhu he niye calo\nAlor oi jharana dharar pane\n\nBandhu he niye calo\nAndharer vyatha ar seye na prane\n\nBandhu he niye calo\nGhumer ghor bhanganor gane gane\n\nBandhu he niye calo",
    "english_meaning": "O dearest Friend, lead me on. Lead me unto the fountain of effulgence. O dearest Friend, lead me on. I can no longer bear the pain of darkness in my heart. O dearest Friend, lead me on. With Your songs, break my deep slumber. O dearest Friend, lead me on.",
    "hindi_meaning": "हे प्रिय सखा, मुझे आगे ले चलो। प्रकाश के उस झरने की ओर मुझे ले चलो। मैं अब हृदय में अंधकार का दुख नहीं सह सकता। अपने गीतों से मेरी गहरी नींद तोड़ दो।",
